SUMMARY:Interchange Message: Liverpool Street: No Step Free Access - Until 
 26 November 2026\, no step free access between the National Rail concourse
  and the eastbound Circle\, Hamm & City and Metropolitan lines due to 
 planned lift maintenance. Use the Elizabeth line entrance on Broadgate for
  step free access.
